WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.901
-Welcome back, everybody!
I'm here with Pete Davidson!

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:07.234
♪♪

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:08.234
-Thank you for doing

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:09.934
Random Instrument Challenge
with me.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.767
-Oh, thanks for having me.
-I appreciate it, buddy.

00:00:11.767 --> 00:00:13.834
-That was an experience
I'll never forget, for sure.

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:16.634
[ Laughter ]
-Before we talk about anything,

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:18.767
I wanted to ask you about this,

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:21.567
because I heard about this thing
that Alec Baldwin --

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.300
-Yeah.
-He asked you,

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:24.534
"How do you stay in shape?"

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:28.267
So he does 100 push-ups
and 100 sit-ups a day.

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.901
-Yeah.
-Now, have you heard that,

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.167
and is it true,
that you do 100 push-ups?

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:36.067
-No.
So, I was on set,

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.667
and Alec was hosting,
and it was a sketch

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:41.934
where I had to be shirtless
and, like, you know,

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:45.133
I guess, like, I'm a little bit
cut or whatever.

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.834
So he came up...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.567
There's no, like,
nice way to say that.

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:51.868
Okay?
-I've never said that.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:56.300
-So he came up to me, and he
was like, "What do you do?"

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.734
And I didn't want to be rude
and say, like,

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.801
"I just still have metabolism."

00:01:01.801 --> 00:01:03.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:06.601
So...
[ Laughter continues ]

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:08.667
I'm not in my mid-50s.

00:01:08.667 --> 00:01:10.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:11.400
I just wake up like this.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:15.133
So to make him feel better,
I was like,

00:01:15.133 --> 00:01:19.334
"Oh, man, I do 100 push-ups
and 100 sit-ups every day."

00:01:19.334 --> 00:01:21.267
And he was like, "Got it."

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:22.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.601 --> 00:01:26.000
And then -- And then he got
the Trump gig.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.667
And so I would see him
every week, and every time

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.167
we would run into each other
in the hall, he would be like,

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:31.701
"100 a day."

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:36.367
And he started to do it,
and he lost like 100 pounds.

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:38.033
-Yeah, he looks fantastic.
-Yeah.

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.467
And it says it's all
'cause of me.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:45.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.501
-That is my favorite, dude.

00:01:47.501 --> 00:01:49.200
I wanted to hear
about that story.

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.968
-Yeah.
-I wanted your opinion on this.

00:01:50.968 --> 00:01:53.033
This is a very local story,
but it's a big story.

00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:56.834
New York City is now legal.
They're legalizing weed.

00:01:56.834 --> 00:01:58.701
-Yeah.
-What do you think about that?

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:00.267
Any thoughts?
And what --

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:04.734
-I think you can see it in my
eyes how happy I am.

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:07.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:07.634 --> 00:02:10.334
It's 12 years too late for me
and my police record,

00:02:10.334 --> 00:02:12.133
but other than that...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.133 --> 00:02:13.434
I think it's a great thing.

00:02:13.434 --> 00:02:15.601
I think, like, you know,
finally.

00:02:15.601 --> 00:02:17.067
It's a cool thing for the city.

00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:18.200
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.734
-Will anything change for you?

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:20.968
-Well, you're a giant pothead.

00:02:20.968 --> 00:02:22.734
[ Laughter ]
No, I'm just kidding.

00:02:22.734 --> 00:02:25.400
-I mean,
I'm just getting the contact.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:27.033
I'm feeling something right now.

00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:29.501
But I just find it interesting.

00:02:29.501 --> 00:02:31.200
I don't know
how much will change, I guess.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.100
-No.
For me, nothing.

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.367
[ Laughter ]
-Yes.

00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:36.501
-But it is, like,
it's a great thing for,

00:02:36.501 --> 00:02:38.467
you know, I think, for the city,
so I'm excited.

00:02:38.467 --> 00:02:39.901
-Good.
How's everything going upstairs

00:02:39.901 --> 00:02:41.067
