which is awesome.

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.534
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:49.200
-You've had a great season.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.734
You have a lot of
good things happening

00:02:50.734 --> 00:02:52.133
I want to talk to you about,

00:02:52.133 --> 00:02:54.634
