00:03:04.167 --> 00:03:05.868
Congrats on that.
-Thank you.

00:03:05.868 --> 00:03:08.400
-What was it like
acting with Questlove?

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.100
-Oh, dude, total pro.
-Wow.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.467
