which was cool.

00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:27.801
Yeah.
-Yeah, I saw that part.

00:03:27.801 --> 00:03:29.334
-I asked him if he would really
hit me and he said no.

00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:30.834
-He told you to hit him
for real.

00:03:30.834 --> 00:03:32.701
-Yeah.
-No.

00:03:32.701 --> 00:03:34.501
-He's like, "I don't feel it.
Hit me for real."

00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:36.067
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.067 --> 00:03:38.000
-I thought it would be cool
